WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.015 --> 00:00:02.456
LAYLA EL-FAOULY
Marc! You have a choice!

00:00:02.507 --> 00:00:04.434
MARC SPECTOR
I have to finish this.

00:00:04.484 --> 00:00:05.751
 If not, I'll never be free.

00:00:07.617 --> 00:00:09.460
KEVIN FEIGE
With our Disney+ series, there were

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.262
characters who we
wanted to introduce for the first time.

00:00:13.492 --> 00:00:18.268
Moon Knight was at the top of that list.
And we wanted a spectacular actor.

00:00:18.565 --> 00:00:19.890
MARC SPECTOR
What the hell is wrong with you, Steven?

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.188
Stay out of my way.

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:22.976
STEVEN GRANT
Me? You're the one going on a

00:00:23.026 --> 00:00:23.956
killing spree.

00:00:25.815 --> 00:00:27.500
OSCAR ISAAC
Mohamed went for actors that

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.283
I think he just
intuitively know commit.

00:00:32.975 --> 00:00:34.487
MOHAMED DIAB
I love May as an actress.

00:00:34.956 --> 00:00:40.499
It was very important to me as an Arab
to find someone who can represent us.

00:00:42.013 --> 00:00:43.208
[Screaming]

00:00:43.568 --> 00:00:45.159
ANTONIA SALIB
Being half Egyptian myself,

00:00:45.209 --> 00:00:48.131
it's great that I get to
play this mythical character.

00:00:49.762 --> 00:00:51.971
KEVIN FEIGE
He's a much more action-oriented character

00:00:52.021 --> 00:00:53.888
in a way we
haven't seen in the MCU.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:00.036
ETHAN HAWKE
The form of movies is changing.

00:01:00.086 --> 00:01:04.690
 It's a movie on a larger canvas
with that level of cinema and quality.

00:01:04.867 --> 00:01:06.419
OSCAR ISAAC
I would never have guessed that this

00:01:06.469 --> 00:01:09.403
would be one of my
most creatively fulfilling adventures.

00:01:09.461 --> 00:01:10.737
It was just amazing.

00:01:12.242 --> 00:01:14.449
STEVEN GRANT
Oh man, this is mental.

